From: psX Linux contributors
Subject: [PATCH] amdgpu: gate PS4 UVD job BO and SA lifetime

Base files match native-frame-build-02/work/source; parent runtime owns the
explicit gate bridge, hardware completion observation and no-reset timeout
dispatch. This patch alone is not a working or qualified UVD driver.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_job.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_job.h
@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@
 #define AMDGPU_JOB_GET_VMID(job) ((job) ? (job)->vmid : 0)
 
 struct amdgpu_fence;
